{"id":"85bd8bb39708cdd0","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-fixed-point-construction.md","title":"单调跳跃的超限固定点构造","display":"lem-fixed-point-construction — 单调跳跃的超限固定点构造","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-fixed-point-construction","aliases":["91-lem-fixed-point-construction"],"display":"lem-fixed-point-construction — 单调跳跃的超限固定点构造","depends_on":["[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-fixed-point-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-fixed-point-construction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-fixed-point-construction — 单调跳跃的超限固定点构造"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0caf6a4fb6071bd3\" href=\"?note=0caf6a4fb6071bd3\" title=\"91-thm-fixed-point-existence\">91-thm-fixed-point-existence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\sqsubseteq)\">\\((L,\\sqsubseteq)\\)</span> 为带最小元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_L\">\\(\\bot_L\\)</span> 的完备格。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\">\\(\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\sqsubseteq)\">\\((L,\\sqsubseteq)\\)</span> 是完备格)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:L\\to L\">\\(J:L\\to L\\)</span> (自映射)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\,(x\\sqsubseteq y\\to J(x)\\sqsubseteq J(y))\">\\(\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\,(x\\sqsubseteq y\\to J(x)\\sqsubseteq J(y))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Hartogs}(L)\">\\(\\eta\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Hartogs}(L)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X:\\eta\\to L\">\\(X:\\eta\\to L\\)</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_0=\\bot_L\">\\(X_0=\\bot_L\\)</span>、\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\alpha+1}=J(X_\\alpha)\">\\(X_{\\alpha+1}=J(X_\\alpha)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha+1&lt;\\eta\">\\(\\alpha+1&lt;\\eta\\)</span>）及\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\lambda=\\bigsqcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}X_\\beta\">\\(X_\\lambda=\\bigsqcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}X_\\beta\\)</span>\n（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;\\lambda&lt;\\eta\">\\(0&lt;\\lambda&lt;\\eta\\)</span> 为极限序数）唯一确定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\">\\(\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0caf6a4fb6071bd3\" href=\"?note=0caf6a4fb6071bd3\" title=\"91-thm-fixed-point-existence\">91-thm-fixed-point-existence</a> 的一般完备格定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\land\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\exists\\kappa\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\kappa+1&lt;\\eta\\land\nX_\\kappa=X_{\\kappa+1}=J(X_\\kappa)=\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\land\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\exists\\kappa\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\kappa+1&lt;\\eta\\land\nX_\\kappa=X_{\\kappa+1}=J(X_\\kappa)=\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>单调性保证阶段递增；极限阶段取已有阶段的上确界。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 是集合大小\n的完备格，若每个有定义的相邻阶段都严格增长，则\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\mapsto X_\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\mapsto X_\\alpha\\)</span> 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的单射，违反 Hartogs 性质。\n故某个满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa+1&lt;\\eta\">\\(\\kappa+1&lt;\\eta\\)</span> 的闭包阶段有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\kappa=X_{\\kappa+1}\">\\(X_\\kappa=X_{\\kappa+1}\\)</span>。\n对每个前固定点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>，超限归纳给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\alpha\\sqsubseteq z\">\\(X_\\alpha\\sqsubseteq z\\)</span>；\n闭包阶段自身又为固定点，故等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\">\\(\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>仅有“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 定义良好”并不能推出固定点存在；完备格与单调性是这里的\n关键条件。闭包也通常不是有限或仅 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 次迭代，因此不能把\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_{n&lt;\\omega}J^n(\\bot_L)\">\\(\\bigcup_{n&lt;\\omega}J^n(\\bot_L)\\)</span> 无条件认作固定点。</p>\n<p>来源：集合大小完备格上的超限递归与 Hartogs 论证；原书 §8.7、§15.1 是幂集特例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-fixed-point-existence","status":"resolved","id":"0caf6a4fb6071bd3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-fixed-point-existence","status":"resolved","id":"0caf6a4fb6071bd3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{lfp}(J)$ 采用 [[91-thm-fixed-point-existence]] 的一般完备格定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"(L,\\sqsubseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"(L,\\sqsubseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"J:L\\to L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\,(x\\sqsubseteq y\\to J(x)\\sqsubseteq J(y))","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Hartogs}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"X:\\eta\\to L","display":false},{"tex":"X_0=\\bot_L","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\alpha+1}=J(X_\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha+1<\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\lambda=\\bigsqcup_{\\beta<\\lambda}X_\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"0<\\lambda<\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lfp}(J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\land\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\exists\\kappa\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\kappa+1<\\eta\\land\nX_\\kappa=X_{\\kappa+1}=J(X_\\kappa)=\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\mapsto X_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa+1<\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\kappa=X_{\\kappa+1}","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\alpha\\sqsubseteq z","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lfp}(J)","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup_{n<\\omega}J^n(\\bot_L)","display":false}],"bytes":2112,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-165","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-fixed-point-construction]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-164","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-fixed-point-construction]]"}],"outgoing":["0caf6a4fb6071bd3"]}